extends ../../base-email

block content
  tr
    td(style="padding: 40px 40px 32px;")
      // Heading
      h1(style="margin: 0 0 20px; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 32px; color: #202124; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; text-align: left;") Confirm your email to join
      
      // Main message
      p(style="margin: 0 0 20px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; color: #5F6368; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; text-align: left;")
        | Hello! Use the verification code below to complete your account verification.
      
      // Expiry notice
      p(style="margin: 0 0 32px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; color: #5F6368; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; text-align: left;")
        | This code expires in 
        span(style="font-weight: 500; color: #202124;")= expiry
        | .


      // OTP Code - Large Prominent Display
      table(cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin: 32px 0 0; width: 100%;")
        tr
          td(align="left" style="padding: 0;")
            table(cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background-color: #F5F5F5; border-radius: 8px; padding: 32px 40px;")
              tr
                td(align="left" style="padding: 0;")
                  p(style="margin: 0; font-size: 48px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2; color: #202124; letter-spacing: 2px; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; text-align: left;")= code
      
      // Disclaimer
      p(style="margin: 32px 0 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; color: #5F6368; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; text-align: left;")
        | If you didn't request this email, there's nothing to worry about — you can safely ignore it.
      
      // Security notice
      p(style="margin: 32px 0 0; padding-top: 24px; border-top: 1px solid #E8EAED; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; color: #5F6368; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; text-align: left;")
        | For your security, never share this code with anyone. Our team will never ask for your verification code.

